    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/a2d8bff109561d9c98c2fd5ed3852753.avif?t=1753646319\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><br>Survival means digging deeper \u2014 into the woods, the bunkers, and the dark.<br><br>Scattered across the woods, hidden bunkers look like ordinary doomsday shelters \u2014 until you step inside. Behind the steel doors, military labs stay locked down, still humming with the leftovers of experiments they couldn't control. Some bunkers hold rare gear. Others hold something worse. If you\u2019re brave enough to break in, be ready for what\u2019s waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/b723d8ecee30a982d0d0dda7ae28830c.poster.avif?t=1753646319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/b723d8ecee30a982d0d0dda7ae28830c.webm?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/b723d8ecee30a982d0d0dda7ae28830c.mp4?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightwalk Simulator DOES NOT hold your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/8361fd127fd8e92e4f5b77e1efa3c83e.poster.avif?t=1753646319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/8361fd127fd8e92e4f5b77e1efa3c83e.webm?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/8361fd127fd8e92e4f5b77e1efa3c83e.mp4?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped in a warped version of rural Georgia, where the night never ends and the dead don\u2019t stay down. <strong>Zombies don\u2019t stumble\u2014they sprint. Full speed. No hesitation.</strong> They won\u2019t stop until you stop them, and if you miss your shot, you won\u2019t get a second chance. <strong>Aliens stalk the glow of streetlights, getting stronger the closer they get.</strong> The deeper you go, the more they spread. And the <strong>ships?</strong> They hunt from above, scanning the roads for anything still breathing. If your flashlight is on, <strong>they will see you.</strong> If they see you, <strong>you run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/6a87c783d5c2ad9f7ead9b99ac3bfdad.poster.avif?t=1753646319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/6a87c783d5c2ad9f7ead9b99ac3bfdad.webm?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/6a87c783d5c2ad9f7ead9b99ac3bfdad.mp4?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bullet matters. Every battery is a lifeline. You can\u2019t waste either. You\u2019ll need to <strong>scavenge, outmaneuver, and think fast</strong> if you want to survive. There\u2019s nowhere to hide\u2014the forest swallows the moonlight, the roads stretch into nothing, and the screams in the distance mean <strong>something else is out there.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re lucky, you\u2019ll stumble across a <strong>ringing payphone.</strong> Walk up, interact, and you might just get your hands on something <strong>random</strong>\u2014an <strong>SMG, a better pistol, or something even deadlier</strong> to help you fight back instead of running for your life.<br><br> A true quintuple-A experience \ud83d\ude08 </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/a2d8bff109561d9c98c2fd5ed3852753.avif?t=1753646319\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><br>Survival means digging deeper \u2014 into the woods, the bunkers, and the dark.<br><br>Scattered across the woods, hidden bunkers look like ordinary doomsday shelters \u2014 until you step inside. Behind the steel doors, military labs stay locked down, still humming with the leftovers of experiments they couldn't control. Some bunkers hold rare gear. Others hold something worse. If you\u2019re brave enough to break in, be ready for what\u2019s waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/b723d8ecee30a982d0d0dda7ae28830c.poster.avif?t=1753646319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/b723d8ecee30a982d0d0dda7ae28830c.webm?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/b723d8ecee30a982d0d0dda7ae28830c.mp4?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightwalk Simulator DOES NOT hold your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/8361fd127fd8e92e4f5b77e1efa3c83e.poster.avif?t=1753646319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/8361fd127fd8e92e4f5b77e1efa3c83e.webm?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/8361fd127fd8e92e4f5b77e1efa3c83e.mp4?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped in a warped version of rural Georgia, where the night never ends and the dead don\u2019t stay down. <strong>Zombies don\u2019t stumble\u2014they sprint. Full speed. No hesitation.</strong> They won\u2019t stop until you stop them, and if you miss your shot, you won\u2019t get a second chance. <strong>Aliens stalk the glow of streetlights, getting stronger the closer they get.</strong> The deeper you go, the more they spread. And the <strong>ships?</strong> They hunt from above, scanning the roads for anything still breathing. If your flashlight is on, <strong>they will see you.</strong> If they see you, <strong>you run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/6a87c783d5c2ad9f7ead9b99ac3bfdad.poster.avif?t=1753646319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/6a87c783d5c2ad9f7ead9b99ac3bfdad.webm?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/6a87c783d5c2ad9f7ead9b99ac3bfdad.mp4?t=1753646319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bullet matters. Every battery is a lifeline. You can\u2019t waste either. You\u2019ll need to <strong>scavenge, outmaneuver, and think fast</strong> if you want to survive. There\u2019s nowhere to hide\u2014the forest swallows the moonlight, the roads stretch into nothing, and the screams in the distance mean <strong>something else is out there.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re lucky, you\u2019ll stumble across a <strong>ringing payphone.</strong> Walk up, interact, and you might just get your hands on something <strong>random</strong>\u2014an <strong>SMG, a better pistol, or something even deadlier</strong> to help you fight back instead of running for your life.<br><br> A true quintuple-A experience \ud83d\ude08 </p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019ve got a Pistol, a flashlight, and two hands\u2014but only one at a time. That means making a choice: see what\u2019s coming or be ready to shoot.",
